[agent] I see the error! The issue is that the SQL query has double quotes around the account IDs, but in SQL, string literals should use single quotes. The error is:
[agent] ```
[agent] [PARSE_SYNTAX_ERROR] Syntax error at or near 'USE': extra input 'USE'. SQLSTATE: 42601
[agent] ```
